<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich inflation flat in April vs March.</title>
<headline>Zurich inflation flat in April vs March.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss consumer prices in the city of Zurich were unchanged in April versus March, the Zurich statistics office said.</p>
<p>The April consumer index showed a year-on-year rise of 0.5 percent versus a 0.4 increase in March. The office said the 0.1 percentage point increase in the index to 103.4 from 103.3 in March, versus flat April inflation, was due to rounding.</p>
<p>				   Apr 1997	Mar 1997    Apr 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change  0.0 pct	-0.2 pct     0.0 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation	     0.5 pct	 0.4 pct     0.8 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)    103.4	   103.3	 102.9</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
